WEBVTT

01:40.060 --> 01:42.990
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.090 --> 01:45.960
[Episode 6]

01:49.229 --> 01:50.229
Zhu Yan.

01:50.870 --> 01:53.630
I still like to talk to you face to face.

02:01.070 --> 02:02.750
Zhao Yuanzhou.

02:05.160 --> 02:06.790
Our game

02:08.020 --> 02:10.350
has just begun.

02:19.530 --> 02:21.090
It really was you.

02:55.320 --> 02:56.520
Are you okay?

02:58.190 --> 02:59.340
What are you doing?

03:01.520 --> 03:03.240
I did it to save you two.

03:03.280 --> 03:04.540
Did I ask you to save me?

03:07.640 --> 03:09.360
I won't die anyway.

03:10.030 --> 03:12.160
Taking a few hits for you is no big deal.

03:18.079 --> 03:19.360
Who is he?

03:20.710 --> 03:22.760
A scumbag who has to

03:23.800 --> 03:24.610
stay hidden.

03:33.200 --> 03:34.530
What happened to Ran Yi?

03:35.370 --> 03:37.310
Ran Yi was controlled by Li Lun.

03:37.890 --> 03:39.579
Weak demons

03:40.150 --> 03:42.550
are easily controlled by powerful demons.

03:44.460 --> 03:45.270
Zhu Yan,

03:47.030 --> 03:50.579
you're making worse and worse friends.

03:51.800 --> 03:55.640
At least, you used to interact with the Baize Goddess.

03:57.620 --> 03:58.590
Now,

03:58.590 --> 04:00.540
even these cheap things

04:00.540 --> 04:02.350
can order you around.

04:06.230 --> 04:07.730
You didn't know, right?

04:09.210 --> 04:12.330
He and Zhao Wan'er were as close as brother and sister.

04:13.730 --> 04:16.110
Zhao Wan'er even gave him

04:16.130 --> 04:19.070
the name of her late brother, Zhao Yuanzhou.

04:20.709 --> 04:21.779
Zhu Yan.

04:23.470 --> 04:25.140
Am I right?

04:26.630 --> 04:29.240
One was the noble Baize Goddess.

04:29.670 --> 04:32.690
One was the evil great demon, Zhu Yan.

04:34.870 --> 04:36.600
Because he didn't want others to know

04:36.600 --> 04:38.430
they were close,

04:40.220 --> 04:41.670
every time

04:41.670 --> 04:44.390
he was with Zhao Wan'er,

04:45.990 --> 04:47.790
he would wear a mask.

04:52.510 --> 04:53.630
It really is you.

05:24.740 --> 05:26.020
Zhuo Yichen,

05:27.330 --> 05:29.520
don't you want to

05:30.190 --> 05:32.020
avenge your blood feud?

05:33.460 --> 05:35.680
Although he had no choice,

05:36.710 --> 05:40.110
he did kill your father and brother.

05:41.470 --> 05:43.690
If your dead father and brother

05:43.750 --> 05:47.060
saw you fighting alongside the enemy,

05:47.610 --> 05:49.420
how could they

05:51.180 --> 05:52.810
rest in peace?

05:56.680 --> 05:58.030
I can't kill him.

06:00.470 --> 06:01.830
You can.

06:04.050 --> 06:06.330
With my help,

06:07.570 --> 06:09.200
you can.

06:14.670 --> 06:15.560
Okay.

06:35.409 --> 06:38.720
Humans always love to lie.

06:38.830 --> 06:41.220
I will kill Zhao Yuanzhou.

06:42.250 --> 06:46.210
But first, I need to kill you, an even more evil thing.

06:47.350 --> 06:49.210
If you kill me,

06:50.770 --> 06:53.720
no one will know where the Baize Token is.

06:53.750 --> 06:56.210
You know the whereabouts of the Baize Token?

06:57.470 --> 06:59.790
On the night Zhao Wan'er died,

07:00.530 --> 07:02.080
I was sealed,

07:02.840 --> 07:05.800
but I was the only conscious person at the scene.

07:06.000 --> 07:08.600
Naturally, I saw where the Baize Token went.

07:10.040 --> 07:10.840
Where is it?

07:14.110 --> 07:16.030
It's on you.

07:20.590 --> 07:23.160
You saw it in your dream just now.

07:23.990 --> 07:25.160
Right?

07:32.900 --> 07:36.110
But now, you only have half of Baize Token,

07:37.159 --> 07:39.370
so you can’t use it.

07:39.710 --> 07:41.040
Where is the other half?

07:41.880 --> 07:43.270
Do you want to know?

07:48.150 --> 07:49.980
But I don't want to tell you.

07:51.150 --> 07:53.380
You have to say it anyway.

08:22.570 --> 08:25.170
Ran Yi's dream control magic is useless on him.

08:32.380 --> 08:33.720
Really?

08:46.150 --> 08:48.550
He has been running away for so long.

08:50.010 --> 08:50.710
Today,

08:50.710 --> 08:53.540
let him sink into it.

09:17.640 --> 09:18.440
Zhuo!

10:06.610 --> 10:07.410
Chen.

10:10.210 --> 10:12.110
Today is the Double Third Festival.

10:12.110 --> 10:13.910
Why are you still practicing?

10:14.150 --> 10:16.370
I want to practice my swordsmanship

10:16.510 --> 10:19.150
and help Father and Brother in the future.

10:20.140 --> 10:21.610
The Double Third Festival

10:22.570 --> 10:24.010
is not that fun.

10:26.310 --> 10:28.600
I still remember when you were seven,

10:29.240 --> 10:30.640
you came crying

10:30.750 --> 10:31.950
to complain to me

10:32.790 --> 10:34.050
that the others

10:34.110 --> 10:35.970
weren't willing to play with you.

10:36.550 --> 10:38.150
Because your father

10:38.350 --> 10:39.240
and brother

10:39.640 --> 10:41.500
were anomalies who hunted demons

10:42.270 --> 10:44.220
and dealt with demons all the time.

10:44.790 --> 10:46.060
One day,

10:46.090 --> 10:47.890
they would turn into demons too.

10:50.390 --> 10:51.180
Brother,

10:51.980 --> 10:54.310
you still remember the nonsense I said

10:54.950 --> 10:56.190
when I was a kid?

10:57.380 --> 10:59.260
But after so many years,

11:01.270 --> 11:03.400
you indeed haven't made many friends.

11:04.680 --> 11:06.420
You're always alone.

11:10.740 --> 11:11.550
Brother.

11:14.750 --> 11:15.910
Did I

11:19.020 --> 11:21.620
turn myself into an anomaly?

11:24.120 --> 11:25.320
So-called anomalies

11:26.390 --> 11:28.510
are just what narrow-minded people say

11:28.510 --> 11:30.250
in order to team up together

11:30.510 --> 11:33.110
and bring others down.

11:33.870 --> 11:34.860
They use this

11:35.070 --> 11:36.990
to show their righteousness

11:37.390 --> 11:39.650
and hide their own inferiority complex.

11:40.550 --> 11:41.110
Chen,

11:42.300 --> 11:43.780
we were born with

11:43.800 --> 11:45.530
different responsibilities,

11:46.000 --> 11:47.920
so we are destined to bear

11:47.990 --> 11:50.320
the pain that ordinary people don't have.

11:52.230 --> 11:52.760
Brother.

11:55.510 --> 11:57.230
Did you live like this too?

12:05.150 --> 12:06.310
Do you get lonely?

12:09.140 --> 12:10.600
Maybe one day,

12:12.320 --> 12:13.430
you will meet someone

12:13.430 --> 12:15.550
you see as an anomaly.

12:17.150 --> 12:20.010
At that time, you'll need to make your own judgment.

12:20.630 --> 12:22.430
Your eyes lie.

12:23.590 --> 12:24.660
But your heart

12:24.870 --> 12:26.270
will tell you the answer.

12:30.390 --> 12:31.630
I believe you

12:32.230 --> 12:35.110
will surely meet like-minded companions.

12:36.230 --> 12:37.070
By then,

12:37.550 --> 12:39.150
you won't be lonely anymore.

12:43.950 --> 12:44.950
Will that happen?

12:46.750 --> 12:47.840
Of course.

12:50.390 --> 12:51.200
Remember,

12:52.950 --> 12:54.280
one wing is hard to keep.

12:55.340 --> 12:56.970
With two wings, you can soar.

13:41.850 --> 13:42.640
Zhuo!

14:19.940 --> 14:20.850
Zhuo!

14:22.470 --> 14:24.450
Zhuo!

15:22.070 --> 15:23.110
Wen Xiao!

15:56.960 --> 15:57.750
Zhuo Yichen!

15:58.200 --> 15:59.160
Wake up!

16:00.630 --> 16:03.030
The Cloud Light Sword can kill demons and destroy evil

16:03.030 --> 16:04.260
without being tainted by demons.

16:04.260 --> 16:05.750
It can break through

16:05.750 --> 16:07.450
all demonic hallucinations.

16:30.230 --> 16:31.450
He can't be woken up.

16:33.190 --> 16:34.790
Because he has never

16:34.820 --> 16:37.400
truly faced his nightmare.

16:38.060 --> 16:39.820
All these years,

16:40.390 --> 16:43.180
he has never had a dream.

16:44.840 --> 16:49.260
So he can't tell if it's a dream or not.

16:52.080 --> 16:54.550
He won't wake up.

16:56.910 --> 16:58.000
Zhuo!

18:19.030 --> 18:20.510
Zhuo Yichen.

18:22.570 --> 18:24.980
If I'm your nightmare,

18:29.100 --> 18:31.740
then pierce me.

19:07.950 --> 19:09.430
My nightmare

19:11.000 --> 19:12.430
isn't you.

19:20.430 --> 19:22.230
It's myself.

19:28.390 --> 19:30.540
I'm afraid of dreaming

19:31.720 --> 19:32.980
and don't have dreams,

19:35.950 --> 19:37.880
so after my brother died,

19:38.670 --> 19:40.710
I never saw him in my dreams again.

19:44.780 --> 19:46.410
What I must overcome

19:48.430 --> 19:50.830
is myself, who has always been running away

19:52.470 --> 19:54.640
and has always been cowardly.

20:07.150 --> 20:08.720
My nightmare

20:09.230 --> 20:10.460
is myself!

20:09.980 --> 20:16.000
♫Someday I'll return to my old hometown♫

20:16.840 --> 20:22.880
♫Wearing old clothes but with eyes shining bright♫

20:23.850 --> 20:25.840
♫Holding brilliance in the right hand♫

20:25.880 --> 20:27.800
♫Biting down on all panic♫

20:27.820 --> 20:29.300
♫Wiping away frost with the left hand♫

20:29.340 --> 20:31.150
♫I finally look up♫

20:31.180 --> 20:34.030
♫You're in front of me♫

20:34.920 --> 20:37.080
♫Blocking the pain♫

20:50.720 --> 20:55.780
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

20:56.060 --> 20:59.250
♫The dawn stings without hesitation♫

21:01.300 --> 21:03.190
There's no way out of this vast sea

21:03.210 --> 21:05.110
but is in the mortal world.

21:05.260 --> 21:08.150
The galaxy is slim and we hold hands.

21:08.740 --> 21:10.860
Travel together in the world.

21:10.950 --> 21:12.060
Break!

21:20.550 --> 21:22.130
You're useless.

21:40.070 --> 21:40.950
Ran Yi.

21:43.940 --> 21:44.870
Ran Yi.

21:45.310 --> 21:46.230
Ran Yi!

21:51.540 --> 21:52.590
Ran Yi.

21:55.700 --> 21:57.600
Miss Qi.

21:58.650 --> 21:59.710
Ran Yi.

22:02.870 --> 22:03.590
No.

22:08.060 --> 22:09.170
Ran Yi.

22:35.390 --> 22:37.530
She has been parasitized for too long.

22:38.400 --> 22:39.880
Her internal organs

22:40.520 --> 22:43.450
have been corroded by the malicious energy of Li Lun.

23:29.110 --> 23:30.150
Ran Yi.

23:33.110 --> 23:34.670
Do you remember

23:36.030 --> 23:39.410
the first time we met?

23:40.180 --> 23:41.310
Master,

23:41.430 --> 23:44.560
someone took down the notice of your search for famous doctors

23:44.560 --> 23:46.370
and said he can cure the lady's illness.

23:46.370 --> 23:47.210
But he...

23:47.480 --> 23:48.990
He's a little strange.

24:12.740 --> 24:14.740
When we first met,

24:15.630 --> 24:16.920
you covered your face

24:17.030 --> 24:18.780
with fabric

24:19.500 --> 24:21.630
and only revealed your eyes.

24:24.140 --> 24:26.690
But I will always remember

24:27.020 --> 24:28.620
those eyes.

24:29.930 --> 24:31.580
They were like

24:31.630 --> 24:34.490
a lake under the moonlit night sky.

24:34.950 --> 24:36.060
So beautiful.

24:40.510 --> 24:41.160
No.

24:44.570 --> 24:46.200
That wasn't the first time.

24:58.950 --> 24:59.750
My Lady,

24:59.880 --> 25:01.960
why do you always come to the lake?

25:04.380 --> 25:05.780
The books say,

25:06.710 --> 25:08.390
"All rivers return to the sea

25:08.740 --> 25:10.740
and all water returns to the abyss."

25:12.710 --> 25:14.630
But look at this lake.

25:15.590 --> 25:17.790
It's always trapped deep in the forest.

25:18.460 --> 25:20.910
Do you think it can return to the sea?

25:25.100 --> 25:26.360
Who's there?

25:30.860 --> 25:33.460
I was being chased by a demon hunter at the time.

25:33.760 --> 25:35.390
I was severely injured

25:35.980 --> 25:37.840
and was drifting along the water.

25:39.020 --> 25:40.480
In a daze,

25:41.470 --> 25:42.820
I saw you.

25:57.830 --> 25:59.960
I mustered all my strength

26:00.630 --> 26:01.720
to open my eyes

26:01.750 --> 26:03.150
and see you.

26:04.230 --> 26:07.440
You were like the legendary goddess of the Wilderness.

26:07.860 --> 26:09.510
Your eyes were gentle

26:09.750 --> 26:11.090
and compassionate.

26:11.920 --> 26:12.910
Go on.

26:14.990 --> 26:15.920
Go on.

26:19.730 --> 26:20.470
At that time,

26:20.470 --> 26:21.670
I told myself

26:23.160 --> 26:25.070
I must see you again.

26:27.070 --> 26:29.160
You've swum to many places.

26:29.870 --> 26:32.530
You must have seen a lot of beautiful sceneries.

26:36.520 --> 26:38.280
You're so silly.

26:39.620 --> 26:41.680
You've recovered,

26:43.610 --> 26:45.650
but you still refuse to leave.

26:47.430 --> 26:48.550
You can swim

26:48.570 --> 26:50.460
freely in the world,

26:51.030 --> 26:52.630
but you insist on

26:53.930 --> 26:56.160
being trapped in this cage with me.

27:19.590 --> 27:21.580
The sea is vast.

27:22.230 --> 27:24.020
There's no way out,

27:25.470 --> 27:27.230
but it is in the mortal world.

27:30.600 --> 27:33.360
I remember everything you said,

27:35.090 --> 27:37.590
the scenery you wanted to see,

27:38.160 --> 27:40.880
and all kinds of life you wanted to experience.

27:41.910 --> 27:44.210
So from then on,

27:45.610 --> 27:46.510
every night,

27:46.510 --> 27:48.710
I created a dream for you,

27:49.420 --> 27:51.820
so that the wishes you couldn't fulfill

27:51.910 --> 27:53.640
when trapped behind high walls

27:54.270 --> 27:55.630
could come true.

28:10.120 --> 28:12.650
I was willing to be with you forever like this,

28:13.270 --> 28:15.320
even if I had to abandon my freedom

28:15.760 --> 28:18.570
and just be a fish in your fish tank.

28:21.030 --> 28:22.470
But dream control magic

28:23.110 --> 28:24.570
is demonic, after all.

28:25.790 --> 28:28.320
The longer a person stays in a dream,

28:28.470 --> 28:30.030
the weaker one becomes.

28:30.070 --> 28:32.230
I couldn't create dreams for you anymore.

28:32.230 --> 28:33.420
Master.

28:33.440 --> 28:35.620
The lady is still not getting better.

28:35.870 --> 28:37.000
These past few days,

28:37.020 --> 28:38.520
she's become bedridden.

28:40.760 --> 28:42.990
That's why I became a doctor

28:43.390 --> 28:44.680
to accompany you.

28:46.950 --> 28:48.270
I drew,

28:49.830 --> 28:50.750
wrote,

28:51.780 --> 28:53.320
[Classic of Mountains and Seas]

28:51.950 --> 28:53.300
read travel books,

28:54.740 --> 28:57.200
and talked about the world outside with you.

28:58.030 --> 28:59.670
My favorite phrase

29:01.750 --> 29:03.350
is "dreams come true."

29:06.650 --> 29:08.220
When I say it,

29:10.550 --> 29:12.110
I feel so happy.

29:15.480 --> 29:17.280
Whether you are a human

29:17.300 --> 29:18.710
or a demon,

29:21.160 --> 29:23.080
you are both my path

29:24.210 --> 29:25.490
and destination.

29:29.960 --> 29:31.320
Meeting you

29:32.090 --> 29:34.520
is the happiest thing in my life.

29:36.440 --> 29:38.040
I've never regretted it.

29:40.430 --> 29:41.350
Thank you

29:43.140 --> 29:44.960
for giving me the best dream.

29:48.390 --> 29:49.610
But those dreams

29:50.300 --> 29:51.580
hurt you.

29:54.320 --> 29:56.320
I'm not talking about those dreams.

30:00.290 --> 30:01.890
I mean now.

30:03.660 --> 30:05.030
This moment.

31:03.960 --> 31:05.540
Ran Yi committed suicide.

31:11.990 --> 31:13.700
He destroyed his inner core.

31:22.320 --> 31:24.070
You once said

31:24.890 --> 31:26.890
you would take me to the Wilderness,

31:27.180 --> 31:28.900
to your hometown.

31:29.960 --> 31:30.770
Yes.

31:31.480 --> 31:33.650
I'll show you the trees of heaven

31:33.790 --> 31:35.240
and the edge of the sea.

32:18.070 --> 32:19.240
Master said

32:18.730 --> 32:21.520
♫The hazy dusk approaches♫

32:20.510 --> 32:21.420
death

32:21.970 --> 32:23.470
is when someone

32:22.230 --> 32:25.010
♫The old days are sinking and weighing heavy on my heart♫

32:24.760 --> 32:27.230
goes to a place far, far away

32:25.550 --> 32:29.020
♫A great dream covers new clothes♫

32:29.080 --> 32:31.650
♫Sleeping without waking♫

32:30.740 --> 32:32.070
and never comes back.

32:32.480 --> 32:35.260
♫The blue lake traps♫

32:35.870 --> 32:38.760
♫The reflections of old friends♫

32:39.340 --> 32:42.060
♫The ocean tides rise and fall♫

32:42.250 --> 32:45.560
♫Thoughts are inaudible♫

32:46.240 --> 32:49.200
♫Bitter memories♫

32:49.250 --> 32:52.880
♫Hide in the gap of my heart♫

32:52.940 --> 32:55.740
♫One heart chamber, one window♫

32:54.900 --> 32:57.110
But another friend of mine told me

32:55.800 --> 32:58.830
♫Traces of light♫

32:57.810 --> 32:59.470
that your deceased loved ones

32:59.670 --> 33:01.790
will become stars in the sky.

32:59.880 --> 33:02.840
♫Murmuring breaths♫

33:02.920 --> 33:05.840
♫Like riddles by the pillow♫

33:04.890 --> 33:06.060
She told me

33:06.340 --> 33:09.460
♫I only dare to look at you in dreams♫

33:07.660 --> 33:09.820
not to be sad about the past.

33:09.740 --> 33:12.290
♫Yet I don't utter a word♫

33:12.360 --> 33:14.830
Don't be sad about something you can't resist.

33:13.100 --> 33:16.490
♫Let the spring light hear♫

33:16.890 --> 33:19.830
♫The autumn moon also hears♫

33:17.090 --> 33:18.910
Use all your power

33:19.890 --> 33:22.840
♫Every rainfall♫

33:20.470 --> 33:22.510
to grasp what you can fight for.

33:22.910 --> 33:26.290
♫Is my secret♫

33:24.790 --> 33:26.150
Cherish it

33:26.380 --> 33:30.070
♫Searching memories endlessly♫

33:30.140 --> 33:33.050
♫The drenched past♫

33:33.230 --> 33:36.040
♫Reflects you♫

33:36.730 --> 33:39.490
♫Find you♫

33:37.510 --> 33:38.250
Leave.

33:38.590 --> 33:40.250
If you leave, don't come back!

33:50.580 --> 33:51.440
In the end,

33:52.110 --> 33:54.900
just accept what you can't change.

33:55.730 --> 33:57.130
Like death.

33:58.160 --> 33:59.460
Like fate.

34:00.790 --> 34:02.910
Can't fate be changed?

34:05.660 --> 34:07.160
Do you believe in destiny?

34:09.020 --> 34:10.900
What I want to destroy

34:11.790 --> 34:14.580
is what the Goddess is destined to protect.

34:15.610 --> 34:17.150
This is not destiny.

34:18.580 --> 34:20.110
This is my karma.

34:22.840 --> 34:24.590
I know I can't persuade you,

34:25.590 --> 34:26.870
but I believe

34:27.080 --> 34:28.340
that one day,

34:28.389 --> 34:31.190
you will meet the person who makes you want to live.

34:37.449 --> 34:38.780
She said it's possible,

34:39.500 --> 34:40.820
but I don't think so.

34:42.860 --> 34:43.989
What about you?

34:46.300 --> 34:47.690
Will you die too?

34:51.409 --> 34:52.320
Probably.

35:15.940 --> 35:17.500
[The Great Demon will be with Wen Xiao as long as he lives]

35:17.870 --> 35:19.230
But don't worry.

35:20.190 --> 35:22.030
I won't die easily.

35:23.100 --> 35:25.090
I will always be by your side.

35:26.880 --> 35:28.470
Demons live longer than humans.

35:28.020 --> 35:33.340
[The Great Demon will be with Wen Xiao as long as he lives]

35:30.000 --> 35:31.930
I won't leave you by yourself.

36:07.300 --> 36:08.330
I'm not...

36:08.340 --> 36:09.100
My head.

36:09.130 --> 36:10.830
My head.

36:10.870 --> 36:12.150
I'm going to lose my head.

36:12.150 --> 36:14.030
What should I do about my head?

36:15.960 --> 36:17.150
My head!

36:17.170 --> 36:18.110
Mr. Bai Jiu.

36:18.130 --> 36:18.630
Mr. Zhuo

36:18.630 --> 36:21.370
and the others have successfully solved the Water Ghost bride case.

36:21.370 --> 36:23.110
The military order is completed successfully.

36:23.110 --> 36:24.670
Mr. Fan asked me to tell you

36:24.670 --> 36:25.870
not to worry anymore.

36:25.990 --> 36:27.110
Really?

36:27.210 --> 36:28.690
That's great!

36:28.710 --> 36:29.510
Brother Zhuo!

36:29.550 --> 36:30.460
Brother Zhuo!

36:30.510 --> 36:31.590
Watch out, Mr. Bai!

36:41.910 --> 36:42.790
Mr. Bai,

36:42.790 --> 36:45.650
why do you carry so many medicinal bottles with you?

36:53.420 --> 36:56.020
The Demon Hunting Bureau has saved ourselves.

36:57.610 --> 36:58.680
Unfortunately,

37:00.510 --> 37:01.970
we couldn't save the fish.

37:05.750 --> 37:08.500
At least their last moments were happy.

37:09.750 --> 37:11.150
Is happiness important?

37:12.720 --> 37:13.710
Of course.

37:15.390 --> 37:17.590
Actually, happiness isn't important.

37:18.670 --> 37:19.610
You're a demon.

37:19.880 --> 37:21.140
You don't understand.

37:23.980 --> 37:25.650
It's because I'm a demon

37:26.630 --> 37:28.110
that I understand

37:28.390 --> 37:29.990
happiness is not important.

37:31.510 --> 37:33.390
Because every human emotion

37:34.540 --> 37:35.550
is important.

37:37.280 --> 37:38.990
Joy, anger, sorrow, delight,

37:39.310 --> 37:41.570
grief, happiness, union, and separation

37:41.570 --> 37:43.760
converge into a long river.

37:44.840 --> 37:46.460
This long river

37:48.350 --> 37:49.680
is called "a lifetime."

37:51.830 --> 37:52.790
Did you know?

37:54.590 --> 37:56.160
For us demons,

37:57.070 --> 37:58.990
each emotion requires

37:59.390 --> 38:01.120
hundreds or thousands of years

38:01.390 --> 38:02.250
of cultivation

38:02.750 --> 38:04.350
to experience.

38:06.070 --> 38:07.610
So many demons

38:07.670 --> 38:08.990
go a lifetime

38:09.550 --> 38:11.810
without being able to shed a single tear.

38:14.110 --> 38:14.990
So,

38:16.750 --> 38:19.480
stop being obsessed with making everyone happy.

38:27.160 --> 38:29.020
You're still so weak.

38:29.850 --> 38:31.010
Are you worried?

38:37.710 --> 38:38.510
Of course.

38:39.560 --> 38:40.830
Is this worry

38:42.780 --> 38:44.290
also

38:45.750 --> 38:47.990
an important experience for you?

38:52.470 --> 38:53.270
Yes.

38:54.000 --> 38:56.130
Then was pretending you didn't know me

38:56.360 --> 38:59.500
and watching me being confused and ignorant

39:01.470 --> 39:03.630
also an important experience?

39:10.440 --> 39:11.660
Zhao Yuanzhou,

39:14.420 --> 39:15.750
you broke your promise.

39:18.910 --> 39:20.290
Which one?

39:21.750 --> 39:23.030
The same pace

39:24.510 --> 39:26.120
or being colleagues?

39:27.750 --> 39:28.950
You said

39:31.160 --> 39:32.560
you would come to me.

39:42.230 --> 39:43.140
Great Demon,

39:43.900 --> 39:45.310
where are you taking me?

39:46.300 --> 39:47.250
Tiandu.

39:48.110 --> 39:50.440
Aren't you going to keep taking care of me?

39:52.420 --> 39:54.180
I will definitely come to you.

40:00.650 --> 40:02.430
I will definitely come to you.

40:20.170 --> 40:21.320
Haven't I

40:21.980 --> 40:23.720
come to you now?

40:24.960 --> 40:26.170
Then why

40:27.500 --> 40:29.670
didn't you tell me who you were?

40:32.370 --> 40:34.040
Think of it as...

40:41.840 --> 40:43.700
Getting to know each other again.

40:48.130 --> 40:50.670
♫A lone boat drifts through the world♫

40:50.710 --> 40:53.320
♫The heart feels bitter, then sweet♫

40:53.620 --> 40:58.690
♫Can't distinguish night from day♫

40:58.500 --> 41:00.350
I will definitely come to you.

41:00.020 --> 41:01.940
♫At the edge of the dreamscape♫

41:02.000 --> 41:04.620
♫Someone is longing for♫

41:04.690 --> 41:06.200
♫Softly calling for♫

41:06.230 --> 41:10.240
♫A past that can't be brought back♫

41:23.890 --> 41:26.120
If you break the contract

41:26.330 --> 41:27.860
you signed with demon blood,

41:27.860 --> 41:29.540
your soul will vanish.

41:29.310 --> 41:31.440
[Zhao Yuanzhou] [Zhu Yan]

41:29.740 --> 41:31.370
I'm willing

41:31.400 --> 41:33.030
to work with her willingly

41:33.070 --> 41:35.550
like her colleague.

41:35.550 --> 41:36.670
Keep it in mind.

41:36.670 --> 41:38.330
It's the most important term.

41:40.280 --> 41:41.540
Zhao Yuanzhou.

41:43.630 --> 41:44.750
Zhao Yuanzhou!

41:44.980 --> 41:46.170
Zhao Yuanzhou!

42:26.430 --> 42:27.480
Are you okay?

42:34.110 --> 42:36.350
I think I'm about to die.

42:38.670 --> 42:41.310
Mr. Zhuo's Cloud Light Sword is amazing.

42:56.190 --> 42:57.850
Aren't you a great demon?

42:58.160 --> 43:00.760
How can you die after being stabbed a few times?

43:14.490 --> 43:15.820
It's improper for men and women to touch each other.

43:15.820 --> 43:16.680
Even if you want to die,

43:16.680 --> 43:18.350
don't die in Wen Xiao's arms.

43:26.740 --> 43:27.840
It's okay.

43:29.290 --> 43:30.810
I've lived too long.

43:32.190 --> 43:33.400
I'm tired of it.

43:36.580 --> 43:37.710
What a coincidence.

43:38.960 --> 43:40.690
That's what my name means.

43:41.700 --> 43:43.500
You're annoying like your name.

43:46.480 --> 43:48.170
I bear heavy sins

43:49.240 --> 43:50.900
and should have died long ago.

43:52.320 --> 43:53.800
So, Wen Xiao,

43:55.960 --> 43:57.830
don't be sad for me.

43:59.230 --> 44:00.670
The dead demons

44:01.320 --> 44:03.430
become the sun, moon, and stars.

44:05.510 --> 44:06.940
I can also turn into rain.

44:08.650 --> 44:10.640
From now on, whenever it rains,

44:14.420 --> 44:16.360
it'll be me keeping you company.

44:39.350 --> 44:41.400
Actually, I don't like rainy days.

44:44.510 --> 44:46.360
And didn't you say before

44:49.040 --> 44:50.820
you would stay with me

44:53.030 --> 44:54.670
and you wouldn't die easily?

45:18.150 --> 45:19.100
Zhao Yuanzhou.

45:19.130 --> 45:20.120
You are

45:20.180 --> 45:21.470
ridiculous!

45:27.050 --> 45:27.850
Wen Xiao,

45:27.870 --> 45:28.670
he's lying.

45:28.670 --> 45:29.310
Look.

45:45.400 --> 45:46.670
Mr. Zhuo, are you here to thank me

45:46.670 --> 45:48.070
for saving your life?

45:48.870 --> 45:49.940
It's nothing.

45:50.180 --> 45:51.440
Don't get off-topic.

45:52.590 --> 45:53.470
Why did you

45:54.640 --> 45:56.270
kill my father and brother back then?

45:56.270 --> 45:58.730
Although he had no choice,

45:58.760 --> 46:03.270
he did kill your father and brother.

46:03.430 --> 46:05.050
What did Li Lun mean when he said

46:05.050 --> 46:06.420
you had no choice?

46:19.200 --> 46:21.600
I saw it in my dream just now.

46:22.510 --> 46:24.510
He was controlled by the malicious energy.

46:24.510 --> 46:25.700
He had no choice.

46:25.740 --> 46:28.270
That's why he lost control and killed people.

46:30.830 --> 46:31.750
But killing

46:32.790 --> 46:33.950
is killing.

46:41.790 --> 46:42.710
In this world,

46:43.890 --> 46:45.950
there are too many who have no choice.

46:47.710 --> 46:49.660
Some people become robbers

46:49.830 --> 46:50.960
because of poverty.

46:53.350 --> 46:55.880
They commit evil because they are desperate.

46:57.760 --> 46:59.620
They kill because of hatred.

47:00.980 --> 47:03.310
Ran Yi also started killing because he was

47:03.470 --> 47:05.250
harmed by Master Qi.

47:06.680 --> 47:07.990
But these

47:08.840 --> 47:12.050
can't be the excuse for them to escape punishment.

47:26.130 --> 47:27.840
Don’t worry, Mr. Zhuo.

47:30.330 --> 47:32.070
I’ll pay back my debts

47:34.610 --> 47:36.700
after the Baize Token is found.

47:40.250 --> 47:41.300
I will do

47:42.270 --> 47:43.700
what I promised you.

47:49.830 --> 47:50.600
Alright.

47:51.080 --> 47:52.310
We'll talk about

47:52.510 --> 47:54.040
your grudges another time.

47:54.150 --> 47:56.530
Right now, we have to meet up with Ms. Pei

47:57.030 --> 47:58.030
and go back to report.
